# PWA & Service Worker — ZatPat IMS

## Service Worker (`sw.js`)

- Cache name format: `zatpat-v{N}` — bump version when deploying changes
- `STATIC_URLS` array lists every file to pre-cache (HTML, CSS, all JS modules, manifest, icon)
- **When adding a new JS module**: add its path to `STATIC_URLS` and bump `CACHE_NAME`
- Strategy: cache-first for local assets, network fallback
- On activate: old caches are purged by name comparison

## Manifest (`manifest.json`)

- `display: standalone`, `orientation: any`
- Icons: SVG used at all sizes
- `start_url: ./index.html` (relative paths for Vercel/static hosting)

## Hosting

Deployed as static files on Vercel. No server-side rendering, no API routes.
All paths in the app are relative (`./`) to support deployment at any base path.
